hesis that tie directly into UNCG’s priorities of health/medicine or energy/sustainable chemistry are p... View Details Bookmark Physical Chemistry - Assistant Professor- Tenure Track 001096 Chemistry & Biochemistry - 12205 Tenure Stream Internal and External The Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry at the University of North Carolina at Greensboro is seeking to fill a tenure-track faculty position in the area of Physical Chemistry at the rank of Assistant Professor with an anticipated start date of August 2027. Research interests that tie directly into UNCG priorities of Energy, AI/New Technology, and/or Health/Medicine will be greatly preferre... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Psychology 999406 Psychology - 12215 Tenure Stream Internal and External The Department of Psychology at UNC Greensboro invites applications for a tenure-track position in Social Psychology (Assistant Professor) to begin August 1, 2027.We seek someone to join an active and collaborative department. The Department of Psychology consists of 28 full-time faculty and offers a BA and BS in psychology, including Disciplinary Honors, an MA in experimental psychology, and a... View Details Bookmark HR Business Partner 998970 Human Resources - 58401 Administration - Staff 09/07/2026 Internal and External The Human Resources Business Partners collaborate with client groups and HR teams to develop and deliver effective human capital programs and policies and practices that align with business objectives, drive superior business results and contribute to the overall efficiency and effectiveness of the organization. The position will focus primarily on the areas of people strategy and organizationa... View Details Bookmark Early Childhood Teacher Assistant 998072 Human Devlp and Family Studies - 12403 Staff Internal and External Early Childhood Education Teachers Assistants in the Child Care Education Program will work in a classroom as part of the consistent teaching team. They are responsible for assisting the Lead Teacher with curriculum planning in classrooms for young children, maintaining licensing and accreditation standards, creating a respectful high-quality classroom environment, caregiving routines, classroo... View Details Bookmark Assistant Director, Building and Environmental Services 004030 Facilities Operations - 56404 Staff Internal and External The Assistant Director of Building and Environmental Services provides leadership and coordination of housekeeping and custodial services across campus facilities, most often within Housing and Residence Life or Facilities Operations.This position supervises subordinate housekeeping supervisors, delivery personnel, set-up crews, floor maintenance assistants, and housekeeping staff to ensure cle... View Details Bookmark SBTDC Business Counselor 997935 LaunchUNCG - 11506 Research 09/15/2026 Internal and External The University of North Carolina at Greensboro (UNCG) invites applications for a Small Business and Technology Development Center (SBTDC) Business Counselor. This position is funded through the North Carolina Small Business and Technology Development Center and is housed within Innovate UNCG, the university’s hub for innovation, entrepreneurship, commercialization, and economic development.The ... View Details Bookmark Building and Environmental Technician 004178 Facility Services Housekeeping - 56408 Staff 09/14/2026 Internal and External The position is responsible for general and detail cleaning in academic, administrative, and performance buildings on campus. This position also completes floor care, has good customer service skills, and completes other special projects such as furniture supply moves within the academic buildings on campus. Supervisor may assign other job-related duties not specifically listed under essential ... View Details Bookmark Project Technician 003750 Facility Services Housekeeping - 56408 Staff 09/14/2026 Internal and External This position is mainly responsible for completing various projects on campus, including, but not limited to; floor care, furniture moves, inclement weather coverage, absentee coverage, upholstery cleaning and deep cleaning of restrooms/locker rooms. This position also completes general and detail cleaning in academic, administrative, and performance buildings on campus. In addition, his positi... View Details Bookmark Plumber 003824 Utility Operations - 56406 Staff 09/21/2026 Internal and External The primary purpose of this position is the maintenance and repair of campus plumbing systems, from the city water supply to the sewage systems. Included in this is the installation and repair of the plumbing fixtures and planned and preventative maintenance on existing water and sewage disposal systems. This position reports to the Plumbing Shop supervisor and is responsible for the maintenanc... View Details Bookmark Building and Environmental Technician 000029 Facility Services Housekeeping - 56408 Staff 09/14/2026 Internal and External The position is responsible for general and detail cleaning in academic, administrative, and performance buildings on campus. This position also completes floor care, has good customer service skills, and completes other special projects such as furniture supply moves within the academic buildings on campus. Supervisor may assign other job-related duties not specifically listed under essential ... View Details Bookmark Administrative Support Specialist Human Resources - 58401 Temporary Staff 09/30/2026 Internal and External The Department of Human Resources is seeking qualified individuals for temporary Administrative Support Specialist positions that MAY become available on campus. When a UNCG Department is in need of a temporary Administrative Support Specialist, qualified applicants who have applied to this temporary pool will be considered.Duties and responsibilities could include but are not limited to the fo... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Media Studies 1667 Media Studies - 12226 Administration - Faculty Internal and External The Department of Media Studies at UNC Greensboro invites applications for a Tenure-Track Assistant Professor of Media Studies with an emphasis on the History and Critical Analysis of Interactive and Emerging Media to begin August 1, 2027. We seek a scholar whose research explores the history, theory, and cultural and societal impacts of digital platforms, interactive, and emerging media. The s... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Communication Sciences and Disorders 014230 Comm Sciences and Disorders - 13001 Tenure Stream Internal and External The faculty member will be an integral part of the undergraduate and master’s programs in the department. Preference will be given to applicants with teaching and research expertise in dysphagia and motor speech disorders. Interest and experience in TBI, dementia, and voice disorders will also be considered. View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor, Finance 001716 Accounting and Finance - 11812 Tenure Stream Internal and External The Bryan School of Business and Economics is seeking a qualified applicant for a tenure-stream position at the rank of Assistant Professor of Finance (tenure-track) in the Department of Accounting and Finance, beginning August 1, 2027. Candidates from all areas of finance are encouraged to apply; however, the successful candidate is expected to incorporate artificial intelligence meaningfully ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor of Statistics 999705 Mathematics and Statistics - 12227 Administration - Faculty Internal and External The Department of Mathematics and Statistics at the University of North Carolina at Greensboro (UNCG) invites applications for a tenure-track position in Statistics at the rank of Assistant Professor beginning August 1, 2027.The department seeks candidates with strong potential for research and teaching in statistics. Applicants whose research interests include machine learning, artificial inte... View Details Bookmark Clinical Psychology Assistant Professor 002317 Psychology - 12215 Tenure Stream Internal and External The Department of Psychology at the University of North Carolina at Greensboro invites applications for a tenure-track position in Clinical Psychology (Assistant Professor level) to begin August 1, 2027.We seek someone to join an active and collaborative department. The Department of Psychology consists of 28 full-time faculty and offers a BA and BS in psychology, including Disciplinary Honors,... View Details Bookmark Program Assistant - Scheduling Coordinator 999002 Human Devlp and Family Studies - 12403 Staff Internal and External This position is pivotal in fostering a culture of excellence, demonstrating strong leadership, and significantly impacting the organization’s overall efficiency and effectiveness by supporting NCRLAP staff. The key responsibilities include additional leadership assignments (55%), schedule assessments (25%), budget and financial management (15%), and other duties (5%). View Details Bookmark Business Officer 997936 Center-Youth-Families & Comm - 11504 Administration - Staff Internal and External The Business Officer is a member of the CYFCP leadership team. The Business Officer will manage the day-to-day operations of a robust center with 10 active areas of expertise encompassing 63 staff and total externally funded grants in excess of 13 million. This position will serve in a pre-and post-award capacity, develop and manage complex budgets related to the operations of the center as wel... View Details Bookmark Administrative Support Specialist 2679 Dean's Office - ED - 12001 Staff Internal and External This position, housed in the Dean’s Office, will provide support to several areas within the School of Education without administrative support. This position will offer support to School of Education’s Dean’s Office, Business Office, Office of Student Success, and Spartan Education Scholars Program. Other duties include initiating personnel actions, budgeting (including processing all payments... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 Next UNCG Human Resources UNC Greensboro 723 Kenilworth St. Greensboro, NC 27402-6170 Telephone 336.334.5009 Fax 336.334.5585 Back to top Copyright © 2025. UNC Greensboro. All rights reserved. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
